    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "JB Kelly presents this charming three bed mid-terrace home, ideally located in a quiet cul-de-sac within a mature and sought after neighbourhood. The property is within easy walking distance of Bayside DART Station, local shopping centre, a range of excellent schools and the seafront, making it an ideal choice for young families and downsizers alike.\r\n\r\nThe house has been recently upgraded throughout by the current owners, with improvements including new double glazed windows, a modern gas fired central heating system, and a pull-down Stira ladder providing access to a floored attic for additional storage. The ground floor layout has also been remodelled to create a bright open plan space, with galley-style kitchen to the front that flows through to living area at the rear.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises an entrance hall leading to the kitchen and a spacious living/dining room, which opens through glazed sliding doors onto a private rear garden. This outdoor space includes a raised deck and suntrap patio which is ideal for outdoor dining and relaxation. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none, with Bayside Square just a short stroll away, offering a range of new facilities including Aldi, Centra, a medical centre, gym, coffee shop, pharmacy, and more. The seafront promenade and coastal cycle track are also nearby, offering easy access to the outdoors and scenic routes along Dublin Bay.\r\n\r\nViewings are by appointment only through JB Kelly at 01 839 3400."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\n1.80 x 2.30m\r\nTiled floors, secure PVC energy efficient door\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n2.35 x 2.70m\r\nOverlooking open space (not overlooked).\r\nFitted wall and floor mounted presses with hardwood countertops, oven with gas hob, extractor unit, washer dryer, dishwasher.\r\nThrough to…\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining room\r\n4.20 x 6.05m\r\nSpacious open plan space with tiled area for dining through to quality laminate floor at the living area, feature open fireplace with black stone hearth and decorative surround, built in storage and shelving.\r\n2x storage closets, sliding glazed doors to raised deck and private rear garden.\r\n\r\nFirst floor\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n1.75 x 2.70m\r\nLaminate floors, pull-down Stira ladder to storage\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.00 x 1.75m\r\nTiled walls and floors, WC, WHB, bath with shower over.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n2.40 x 3.80m\r\nLaminate floors, built-in wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.40 x 2.10m\r\nLaminate floors\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.10 x 2.50\r\nLaminate floors"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
