        "Content": "- Refurbished throughout\r\n- Gas fired central heating\r\n- Double glazed windows throughout\r\n- Open plan ground floor accommodation\r\n- Block built shed to rear - wired with dryer\r\n- Not overlooked from the front or rear\r\n- Private rear garden\r\n- Quiet cul-de-sac location\r\n- Walking distance to schools, wide range of shops, medical centre, sports facilities, bus and DART, seafront promenade and cycle track"
